WEBVTT

00:01:29.768 --> 00:01:34.255
progeny that is going to reproduce
sexually in the next generation.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.278
A weird jellyfish?

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:38.106
Not quite.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.412
This is an ascidian.

00:01:39.772 --> 00:01:41.056
This is a group of animals

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:44.827
that now we know we share
extensive genomic ancestry with,

00:01:44.851 --> 00:01:49.574
and it is perhaps the closest
invertebrate species to our own.

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:51.745
Meet your cousin,

00:01:51.769 --> 00:01:53.199
Thalia democratica.

00:01:53.223 --> 00:01:55.181
(Laughter)

00:01:55.205 --> 00:01:59.195
I'm pretty sure you didn't save a spot
at your last family reunion

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.651
for Thalia,